    editorCut: "The World-Eclectic editor removed three elements: (1) the linen-weave texture pass — it added a second horizontal texture system that competed with the water-band gradient rather than reinforcing it, and the grain field already does the tactile work; (2) the real-time sky hue-drift over 45 minutes driven by wall-clock timestamp — a beautiful idea that requires the operator to trust a slow process they cannot see or control, and which produces inconsistent results across services of different len",
    openDecision: "Cinzel ALL CAPS or Noto Serif sentence case for the lyric band — the team split on this and did not resolve it. Cinzel at this scale in a dawn-liturgy context reads as declaration, which is correct for a call to worship and wrong for a peace hymn; Noto Serif sentence case reads as breath, which is correct for 'Be still my soul' and may feel insufficiently weighted for a projector at 40 metres. You",
